  "fullDescription": "This Procreate brushes bundle is for those who love Christmas and this Procreate brush pack offer the opportunity to create stunning Christmas inspired designs on their iPad artwork.\n\nIncluded in the Procreate Brushes Christmas Bundle by OkayAnnie:\n– Christmas Stamps & Brushes – 173 Christmas decor, shapes, cookie cutter shapes, embellishments, brushes and floral stamps.\n– Christmas Washi Tapes – 44 hand-drawn Christmas inspired washi tape brushes\n– Bonus Items: 2 Photo Frames, 5 Glitter Papers, 4 Christmas Photo frames in PNG & AI format, 5 Chalkboards\n– Installation Guide\n– Instructions for adjusting brush settings\n\nTips and Tricks for Procreate Christmas Bundle\n– Mix and match the Procreate brushes stamps and washi tapes for versatility\n– Change or add layers of colors to each\n– Adjust the size to create gorgeous bundles\n\nThis bundle is so versatile you could use it for scrapbooking, making social media designs, chalk lettering, card making, digital journalling and so much more!\n\nInstallation:\n– Ensure you have Procreate 5 on your ipad\n– Unzip your file (free download of Zipviewer can be installed on your iPad)\n– Mac User: Airdrop .brushset to your iPad\n– Windows User: Use Dropbox to transfer .brushset. In your Files app on your iPad, navigate your saved file. Tap on .brushset then click on (…) icon and Export. Open In and tap Copy to Procreate.\n– The brush pack will automatically be installed.",
